Changes made for the Gravity platform:
- relayg/nodes.py, relayg/graph.py, relayg/state.py, relayg/tools.py: rewritten or
  modified (model via the Gravity LLM gateway, Gravity tools instead of mock disk tools,
  approval-gated tools instead of langgraph interrupt(), no checkpointer, absolute imports).
- relayg/policy.py: unchanged thresholds; clearer missing/invalid amount reasons.
- agent.py, manifest.yaml, tests: new for this adaptation.

Audit update (1.0.1, 2026-10-08): durable hosted tools with local MCP fallback,
system/user prompt separation, bounded inputs, conservative money grounding,
sourced summary, named unavailable actions, honest draft language, tool-failure
fallbacks and regression tests. No refund API or financial action was added.
Update (1.0.2, 2026-10-08): refund amount filled from a single explicit ticket amount when the model returns null (found in live run).
